  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1702.47 Wastewater facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1702.47 “Wastewater facilities” means “wastewater facilities” as defined in RSA 485-A:2, XIX, as reprinted in Appendix C, namely “the structures, equipment, and processes required to collect, convey, and treat domestic and industrial wastes, and dispose of the effluent and sludge.”\n\nSource. #14203, eff 2-26-25",
